HHIISSTTOORRYY
       ppaammaaddddnnooiissee was added to Netpbm in Version 10.29 (August 2005).  It had
       been distributed by Mike Burns via his own web site  before  that  (and
       continued to be so).

       Burns' version, and the one in Netpbm 10.29, was called ppnnmmaaddddnnooiissee and
       worked only on PNM images.  In Netpbm 10.30, it was converted to handle
       PAM images and renamed to ppaammaaddddnnooiissee.


